## Common Patterns

### Conditional Execution
```cpp
if (parentCPU.getFlag(CPU::FLAG_Z)) {
    // Execute if zero flag set
}

bool n_flag = (parentCPU.CPSR() & CPU::FLAG_N) != 0;
bool v_flag = (parentCPU.CPSR() & CPU::FLAG_V) != 0;
if (n_flag == v_flag) {
    // Execute if N and V have same value (for BGE)
}
```

### Register List Processing
```cpp
for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
    if (register_list & (1 << i)) {
        // Process register i
        parentCPU.R()[i] = parentCPU.getMemory().read32(address);
        address += 4;
    }
}
```

### Sign Extension
```cpp
// 8-bit to 32-bit
int32_t value = static_cast<int8_t>(byte_value);

// 16-bit to 32-bit
int32_t value = static_cast<int16_t>(halfword_value);

// 11-bit to 32-bit
int32_t offset = instruction & 0x7FF;
if (offset & 0x400) {
    offset |= 0xFFFFF800;
}
```

### PC-Relative Addressing
```cpp
// For LDR PC-relative (Thumb format 6)
uint32_t instruction_address = parentCPU.R()[15] - 2;  // Get instruction address
uint32_t pc_base = (instruction_address + 4) & ~0x3;   // Pipeline PC, word-aligned
uint32_t address = pc_base + (offset << 2);            // Add scaled offset
```

