1. Follow existing code style and naming conventions
2. Add DEBUG logging to all new instruction implementations
3. Update timing calculations for new instructions in `thumb_timing.c` or `arm_timing.c`
4. Test thoroughly with known GBA ROMs and test cases
5. Document any special cases or ARM7TDMI quirks
